#: ../../source/deployment-guide/server/docker-troubleshooting.rst:2
msgid "Docker deployment troubleshooting"
msgstr "Docker 배포 문제 해결"

#: ../../source/deployment-guide/server/docker-troubleshooting.rst:5
msgid "Permission issues on M1 Mac"
msgstr "M1 Mac의 권한 문제"

#: ../../source/deployment-guide/server/docker-troubleshooting.rst:7
msgid ""
"If you're deploying the Mattermost server using Docker on an M1 Mac and "
"encountering permission issues in the Docker container, re-create the "
"required directories and set their permissions, then skip the following "
"command because it causes the deploy to stop working."
msgstr ""
"M1 Mac에서 Docker로 OKR.BEST 서버를 배포하다가 Docker 컨테이너에서 권한 "
"문제가 발생하면, 필요한 디렉토리를 다시 생성하고 권한을 설정한 다음, 배포가 "
"작동을 멈추게 하므로 다음 명령은 건너뛰세요."

#: ../../source/deployment-guide/server/docker-troubleshooting.rst:13
msgid ""
"If you're experiencing issues deploying on Docker generally, ensure the "
"docker daemon is enabled and running:"
msgstr ""
"Docker 배포에서 전반적으로 문제가 발생하면 docker 데몬이 활성화되어 실행 "
"중인지 확인하세요:"

#: ../../source/deployment-guide/server/docker-troubleshooting.rst:19
msgid "To remove all data and settings for your Mattermost deployment:"
msgstr "OKR.BEST 배포의 모든 데이터와 설정을 제거하려면:"

#: ../../source/deployment-guide/server/docker-troubleshooting.rst:26
msgid "TLS and NGINX issues"
msgstr "TLS 및 NGINX 문제"

#: ../../source/deployment-guide/server/docker-troubleshooting.rst:28
msgid ""
"For an in-depth guide to configuring the TLS certificate and key for "
"NGINX, please refer to `this document in the repository "
"<https://github.com/mattermost/docker/blob/main/docs/issuing-letsencrypt-"
"certificate.md>`__."
msgstr ""
"NGINX용 TLS 인증서와 키를 구성하는 자세한 가이드는 `리포지토리의 이 문서 "
"<https://github.com/mattermost/docker/blob/main/docs/issuing-letsencrypt-"
"certificate.md>`__\\ 를 참고하세요."

#: ../../source/deployment-guide/server/docker-troubleshooting.rst:31
msgid "Install a different version of Mattermost"
msgstr "다른 버전의 OKR.BEST 설치"

#: ../../source/deployment-guide/server/docker-troubleshooting.rst:33
msgid "Shut down your deployment."
msgstr "배포를 종료합니다."

#: ../../source/deployment-guide/server/docker-troubleshooting.rst:35
msgid ""
"Run ``git pull`` to fetch any recent changes to the repository, paying "
"attention to any potential ``env.example`` changes."
msgstr ""
"``git pull``\\ 을 실행해 리포지토리의 최근 변경 사항을 가져오되, ``env.example``"
"\\ 의 변경 가능성에 주의하세요."

#: ../../source/deployment-guide/server/docker-troubleshooting.rst:37
msgid ""
"Adjust the ``MATTERMOST_IMAGE_TAG`` in the ``.env`` file to point your "
"desired `enterprise <https://hub.docker.com/r/mattermost/mattermost-"
"enterprise-edition/tags?page=1&ordering=last_updated>`__ or `team "
"<https://hub.docker.com/r/mattermost/mattermost-team-"
"edition/tags?page=1&ordering=last_updated>`__ image version."
msgstr ""
"``.env`` 파일의 ``MATTERMOST_IMAGE_TAG``\\ 를 원하는 `enterprise "
"<https://hub.docker.com/r/mattermost/mattermost-enterprise-"
"edition/tags?page=1&ordering=last_updated>`__ 또는 `team "
"<https://hub.docker.com/r/mattermost/mattermost-team-"
"edition/tags?page=1&ordering=last_updated>`__ 이미지 버전을 가리키도록 "
"조정합니다."

#: ../../source/deployment-guide/server/docker-troubleshooting.rst:41
msgid ""
"**For production environments**, we recommend using specific version tags"
" such as ``MATTERMOST_IMAGE_TAG=release-10.5`` rather than generic tags "
"like ``MATTERMOST_IMAGE_TAG=release-10``. Generic ``release-x`` tags are "
"intended for development use only and do not automatically receive new "
"patch releases within that major version. Using specific version tags "
"ensures a more reproducible and deterministic environment for your "
"production deployment."
msgstr ""
"**프로덕션 환경에서는** ``MATTERMOST_IMAGE_TAG=release-10`` 같은 일반 태그 "
"대신 ``MATTERMOST_IMAGE_TAG=release-10.5`` 같은 특정 버전 태그를 사용할 것을 "
"권장합니다. 일반 ``release-x`` 태그는 개발 용도로만 사용하도록 만들어졌으며, "
"해당 메이저 버전 내의 새 패치 릴리스를 자동으로 받지 않습니다. 특정 버전 "
"태그를 사용하면 프로덕션 배포에 더 재현 가능하고 결정적인 환경을 보장할 수 "
"있습니다."

#: ../../source/deployment-guide/server/docker-troubleshooting.rst:43
msgid "Redeploy Mattermost."
msgstr "OKR.BEST를 다시 배포합니다."

#: ../../source/deployment-guide/server/docker-troubleshooting.rst:46
msgid "Unintentional version downgrades"
msgstr "의도하지 않은 버전 다운그레이드"

#: ../../source/deployment-guide/server/docker-troubleshooting.rst:48
msgid ""
"If you experience an unintentional downgrade when using generic "
"``MATTERMOST_IMAGE_TAG=release-x`` tags, this is because these tags are "
"designed for development use and may not point to the latest patch "
"release within that major version."
msgstr ""
"일반 ``MATTERMOST_IMAGE_TAG=release-x`` 태그를 사용할 때 의도하지 않은 "
"다운그레이드가 발생한다면, 이 태그가 개발 용도로 설계되어 해당 메이저 버전 "
"내 최신 패치 릴리스를 가리키지 않을 수 있기 때문입니다."

#: ../../source/deployment-guide/server/docker-troubleshooting.rst:50
msgid ""
"**Solution**: Use a more specific version tag for your Docker image, such"
" as ``MATTERMOST_IMAGE_TAG=release-10.5``, to avoid unexpected version "
"changes and ensure consistent deployments."
msgstr ""
"**해결 방법**: 예상치 못한 버전 변경을 방지하고 일관된 배포를 보장하려면 "
"``MATTERMOST_IMAGE_TAG=release-10.5`` 같은 더 구체적인 버전 태그를 Docker "
"이미지에 사용하세요."

#: ../../source/deployment-guide/server/docker-troubleshooting.rst:54
msgid ""
"A `pipeline improvement "
"<https://github.com/mattermost/mattermost/issues/30656>`__ is in progress"
" to ensure that generic ``release-x`` tags are updated to the latest "
"version from the corresponding release branch. Once this improvement is "
"implemented, the behavior of these tags will be more predictable."
msgstr ""
"일반 ``release-x`` 태그가 해당 릴리스 브랜치의 최신 버전으로 업데이트되도록 "
"`파이프라인 개선 작업 "
"<https://github.com/mattermost/mattermost/issues/30656>`__\\ 이 진행 "
"중입니다. 이 개선이 적용되면 이러한 태그의 동작이 더 예측 가능해집니다."

#: ../../source/deployment-guide/server/docker-troubleshooting.rst:57
msgid "Upgrading from ``mattermost-docker``"
msgstr "``mattermost-docker``\\ 에서 업그레이드"

#: ../../source/deployment-guide/server/docker-troubleshooting.rst:59
msgid ""
"For an in-depth guide to upgrading from the deprecated `mattermost-docker"
" repository <https://github.com/mattermost/mattermost-docker>`__, please "
"refer to `this document "
"<https://github.com/mattermost/docker/blob/main/scripts/UPGRADE.md>`__. "
"For additional help, please refer to `this issue "
"<https://github.com/mattermost/mattermost-docker/issues/489>`__."
msgstr ""
"지원 중단된 `mattermost-docker 리포지토리 "
"<https://github.com/mattermost/mattermost-docker>`__\\ 에서 업그레이드하는 "
"자세한 가이드는 `이 문서 "
"<https://github.com/mattermost/docker/blob/main/scripts/UPGRADE.md>`__\\ 를 "
"참고하세요. 추가 도움이 필요하면 `이 이슈 "
"<https://github.com/mattermost/mattermost-docker/issues/489>`__\\ 를 "
"참고하세요."

